---
const arrow = `<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`;
---

<section class="section company" id="company" aria-labelledby="company-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="lead reveal">
      <p class="label kicker">About Digit</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="company-title">Building the technology behind a new kind of business.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="essay">
      <p class="first reveal">Digit Software develops technology that helps businesses take on more of their own operation.</p>
      <p class="reveal">
        We use that technology across businesses we own in e-commerce, media, marketing, web solutions, and software
        development. Running those businesses gives us a practical way to test what we build, learn from real operations,
        and find out where the technology needs to get better.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        Over time, the same technology can support businesses outside Digit through software products, infrastructure, and
        systems built for their operations.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost cta reveal" href="/company">Learn More <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .company {
    background:
      radial-gradient(700px 500px at 85% 40%, rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.07), transparent 70%),
      var(--bg-0);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .essay p {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    max-width: 32em;
  }

  .essay p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .essay .first {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.3vw, 32px);
    line-height: 1.32;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-stretch: 106%;
    letter-spacing: -0.016em;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 22em;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
